Every graph edge used by the implementation was supplied in section 1.

Use Q*=6pi and a common cosine envelope
f_h(t)=(1-cos(2pi t/h))/h on each slot, zero outside it, with

    h >= max(4 hbar Q*/g, sqrt(4pi hbar Q*/sigma)).

The positive integrated generators for A, Z, full SWAP are the accepted
